    <h2>W02 Learning Activity (1 of 2): Writing Functions</h2>
    <p>Because most useful computer programs are very large, programmers
      divide their programs into parts. Dividing a program into parts
      makes it easier to write, debug, and understand the program. A
      programmer can divide a Python program into modules, classes, and
      functions. In this lesson and the next, you will learn how to write
      your own functions.</p>
